1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Your signature technique
currently has exactly two major flaws.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Huh?

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

5
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,000
[singer singing in English]

6
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,000
[singer singing in English]

7
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,000
COMPASSION X AND X STRENGTH

9
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,000
[narrator] Gon has finally challenged
Knuckle to a serious fight.

10
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,000
However, Knuckle claims
that Gon's technique has major flaws.

11
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:14,000
[Gon] Uh-oh.
I forgot to give my attack a name.

12
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,000
What should it be?

13
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,000
It's Ja… Janken.

14
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Ja-jan Ken, huh?

15
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Okay. I see.

16
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,000
So it's just like rock, paper, scissors,

17
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,000
but the "ja-jan" adds a little oomph,
like a "ta-da!"

18
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Well, not really.

19
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,000
The first "ja" was actually a stutter.

20
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,000
[Killua] You are?

21
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:52,000
[Knuckle] Well, Gon,
your Jajanken has two giant weaknesses.

22
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Those few precious seconds
you're taking before the move

23
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,000
is like an eternity in actual combat,

24
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,000
[grunts]

25
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,000
See, the more aura
you focus into your fist,

26
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:16,000
the less you have at your disposal,

27
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:19,000
and that's less that you'll have
to protect your body.

28
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:23,000
If someone attacks when you're vulnerable,
you're dead.

29
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,000
I know what the risks are.

30
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:28,000
That's why I spent
the last month training,

31
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,000
to make up for them!

32
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,000
But there's one thing he still lacks.

33
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:51,000
-[Gon groans]
-[Knuckle] Experience.

34
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,000
[yells]

35
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,000
[Knuckle] He needs to see
more real combat.

36
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,000
A lot more!

37
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:06,000
He's got plenty of determination,

38
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:10,000
he's faced death many times,
and he has natural talent,

39
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,000
I can tell what he's protecting,

40
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:24,000
and I know what he's planning to do

41
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,000
and stagger my blows a little…

42
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,000
[Gon grunting]

43
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:06,000
[Gon] I was right. Knuckle is…

44
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,000
Okay.

45
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:13,000
Now I think it's time
to throw a real punch.

46
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,000
[Gon] He's so…

47
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Don't blame me if you die, all right?

48
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,000
[Gon] He's so kind.

49
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
[Knuckle] Behind you!

50
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:40,000
[Gon] He doesn't have to teach me,
but still he keeps giving me advice.

51
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,000
[grumbles]

52
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
[groaning]

53
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,000
Was that all you got?

54
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,000
Huh?

55
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:32,000
So act like it. Fight to kill!

56
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:41,000
Show me… rock!

57
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,000
[Gon] Here goes.

58
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Jan…

59
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,000
[yells]

60
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:05,000
All right, now show me rock!

61
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,000
Jan…

62
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:26,000
[Knuckle] That little bastard,
he faked me out with his Jajanken.

63
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:31,000
You were focused
on stopping my special technique.

64
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:35,000
Even I could tell exactly how and when
you were about to strike with your right.

65
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:41,000
[Killua] He used Jajanken's weakness,
the long windup, to his advantage.

66
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,000
He can't help but take a swing.

67
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:55,000
It's straight down the middle,
and he's gotta hit it.

68
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,000
That's the trigger.

69
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,000
The same thing goes for aura.

70
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Unless it's consciously held back,
aura focuses where he tenses up,

71
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,000
and it balloons
the moment he tries to strike.

72
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:23,000
If the Nen user is inexperienced
or loses his cool,

73
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:28,000
the aura will either stagnate
or, conversely, flow too freely.

74
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:36,000
So act like it. Fight to kill!

75
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:40,000
[Killua] Gon pointed out
Knuckle's soft side to upset him,

76
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:42,000
which made the feint successful.

77
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:47,000
This plan is more effective on someone
who knows Jajanken's strength.

78
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:53,000
As soon as Gon initiates the attack,
fear sets in.

79
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,000
once the opponent
figured out how it works,

80
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:13,000
that it was flawed.

81
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:17,000
But, no, he can adapt it to any situation.

82
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Right. Now let's start over.

83
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,000
[Killua] In the second attempt,
Gon was too focused on the technique,

84
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:33,000
it'll be harder to distinguish
between the feints and the real thing.

85
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:39,000
So then, did Gon know
how to overcome this weakness?

86
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,000
No.

87
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,000
He must have figured it out
during the fight.

88
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:55,000
Even in the middle of intense combat,
he's making incredible progress.

89
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:05,000
and it hasn't even been 20 minutes.

90
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:10,000
I'm using more energy
because I'm moving at the same time,

91
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,000
[both grunt]

92
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:00,000
He's getting used to Knuckle's speed,

93
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:02,000
so surprise blows
aren't hitting him anymore.

94
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:10,000
He doesn't have much stamina left
to maintain his aura.

95
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:22,000
Unfortunately, Jajanken requires
a huge amount of aura just to activate.

96
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Gon's used up a lot of aura
in feints alone.

97
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,000
He's already used his technique
three times.

98
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,000
They started fighting 20 minutes ago.

99
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:38,000
If he uses Jajanken again,

100
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,000
that means he'll only have
a minute or two left

101
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,000
to fight at full strength.

102
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,000
[Gon panting]

103
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,000
Wait.

104
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,000
What the hell is he thinking?

105
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,000
[Knuckle gasping]

106
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:33,000
Now show me rock!

107
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,000
[Knuckle] This will definitely be
Gon's final attack.

108
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
It'll all end right here.

109
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:59,000
Janken…

110
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:02,000
paper!

111
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,000
[both gasp]

112
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,000
[Knuckle] An emission attack?

113
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:18,000
You're an enhancer, no doubt about it.

114
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:21,000
Paper's an emission, so it's much weaker.

115
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:25,000
No speed, no punch.

116
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:29,000
There can't possibly be a gimmick
in such a low-level attack.

117
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,000
I'll deflect it, and it's over.

118
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,000
[shouts]

119
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,000
[Gon] All right. Round two.

120
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:40,000
[Knuckle] Round two?

121
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,000
He used a decoy to ambush me.

122
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:48,000
No good. A Jajanken combo attack!

123
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:52,000
[Gon] Rock!

124
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,000
[screaming]

125
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,000
[groaning]

126
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,000
He's out cold.

127
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:36,000
-[footsteps approaching]
-Huh?

128
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:44,000
Where the hell are you going now,
you fool?

129
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,000
[Killua] I'm heading back.

130
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,000
Aren't you going to fight me?

131
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:49,000
I'm ready for more.

132
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,000
You can fight with Gon again tomorrow.

133
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,000
The outcome will probably be different.

134
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:07,000
He'd better be ready to die!

135
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:27,000
but if you lose
without fighting at full strength,

136
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,000
I won't forgive you.

137
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:56,000
and furthermore, why are you allowing them
to criticize you for it?

138
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:07,000
Bastard.

139
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:12,000
You're pretty damn cocky when
you're not shaking in your boots, huh?

140
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,000
In case you forgot,
it's been a whole month,

141
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:17,000
and all you've done is stalk them.

142
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,000
I'll do it.

143
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,000
Tomorrow, I…

144
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:39,000
[Biscuit] Don't worry.
I gave him a massage,

145
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:42,000
so he'll be able to fight
in top form tomorrow.

146
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,000
Killua's the real issue.

147
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:47,000
I mean, I really wasn't expecting him

148
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:50,000
to go the entire month
without fighting once.

149
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,000
Killua!

150
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,000
Huh? [gasps]

151
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:59,000
Prepare yourself to fight me.

152
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,000
[muscles shifting]

153
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,000
[Gon] Whoa! What happened to your face?

154
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:13,000
I was training with Bisky.

155
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:16,000
Are you sure she wasn't torturing you?

156
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Anyway, what about you?
Are you feeling okay?

157
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,000
[Gon] Yeah, I feel fantastic.

158
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:23,000
I used up all my aura,

159
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:27,000
so I expected that I would be pretty much
wiped out right now, but look!

160
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:29,000
That gorilla…

161
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:32,000
I mean, the old hag's massage
must have worked.

162
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,000
-[sighs] That was close.
-Huh?

163
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:39,000
Listen up. If you tell anyone
what happened yesterday,

164
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:43,000
I'll make your face three times worse.
You got it? [laughs]

165
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:46,000
She really meant it too.

166
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:52,000
[Biscuit] Well?
Are you able to see your weakness now?

167
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,000
[panting]

168
00:17:56,000 --> 00:18:01,000
You give up far too easily,
and you're much too cautious in combat.

169
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:05,000
I'd even go so far as to say
you underestimate yourself.

170
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:11,000
Every time you face an opponent
you perceive is stronger than you,

171
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:14,000
you fight to escape, not to win.

172
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:22,000
It's a problem, but I realize
it's not one of your making.

173
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:25,000
It's the fault
of whoever taught you how to fight.

174
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,000
[gasps]

175
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:37,000
A habit that's as deeply ingrained
as this one is will be difficult to break,

176
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,000
but one thing is for sure.

177
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:02,000
For example, C on his best day
can beat D on his worst.

178
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:07,000
A, B, and C can,
under the proper circumstances,

179
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:10,000
beat D
in spite of the large power differential.

180
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:12,000
But that's them.

181
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:16,000
You, on the other hand,
assume the enemy is always at their best.

182
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:26,000
Even against enemies of equal strength,
you think, "He's tough,"

183
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:29,000
or, "It'd be dangerous if he did this."

184
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:41,000
You would run,
because you think like a loser.

185
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:45,000
You need to overcome
this bad habit right away.

186
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,000
And tomorrow…

187
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,000
if you can't defeat Shoot,

188
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:00,000
you must stay out of Gon's life.

189
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:25,000
-Let's go.
-Okay.

190
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:49,000
A love that's abnormal,
obsessive, and distorted.

191
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:58,000
It's a curse that will take
an enormous amount of effort to break.

192
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,000
[door creaks]

193
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:05,000
[Nen whooshing]

194
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:17,000
[Killua] As to who will emerge victorious,
I honestly don't know.

195
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:54,000
[Knuckle] So whoever loses…

196
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:57,000
[Gon] Gives up their tile to the winner.

197
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:02,000
[narrator] Gon and Knuckle,
Killua and shoot,

198
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:05,000
their long-awaited final battle begins.

199
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:10,000
[closing theme music playing]

200
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:21,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

201
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,000
[upbeat music playing]

202
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,000
[Killua] Are you saying I'm cursed, fool?

203
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:46,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
